 runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 49% of normal in November to December and 178% in May to June. All 8 grids had their driest year in 2007, with grid 16379 down at 53% that year.</p>"}
